<title>KUWAIT: Siemens wins Kuwait $22.4mln cables deal.</title>
<headline>Siemens wins Kuwait $22.4mln cables deal.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>German industrial group Siemens AG has won a 6.794 million dinars ($22.4 million) Kuwait cables contract, the group's agent in Kuwait said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The contract has been signed with (Kuwait's) Electricity and Water Ministry,&quot; said an official from the National &amp; German Electrical and Electronic Services Company, a Siemens agent.</p>
<p>The deal involves providing and installing high voltage cables for the Gulf Arab state's electricity network, he said.</p>
<p>($1 = 0.303 dinar)</p>
</text>
